                        QUERY PLAN                         
-----------------------------------------------------------
 Vec HashAggregate (actual rows=8.00 loops=1)
   Group Key: m
   Groups: 8
   Memory Usage: 40 kB
   ->  Vec Seq Scan on srcd (actual rows=10000.00 loops=1)
